I'm seeing lots of messages of late about how no one would ever know
about the vibrating square, and what order to do the book,
bell, and candle-holder. (Throwback to Zork. :-) Or clues about Medusa.
Well, the Oracle has a limited number of Greater Consultations that
cover exactly these sorts of things. The notable exception is the
way out of the first quest level. (Most people get there before level
14, and leave when the quest leader teleports them. Then, they return
after the quest, and expect the same teleportation, not realizing that
the portal is there where they originally blipped in. That aspect
could definitely be cleaned up a bit. :-)

